   f'Evidence for {title} at stage {i} includes one permitted case, one denied or malformed case, one unavailable dependency, one timeout or cancellation, and one recovery path. Preserve raw output before normalization, identify clock, caching, concurrency, and sampling limits, and distinguish an absent signal from a successful control. If observations conflict, stop the dependent change and route the discrepancy to the {owner} instead of weakening acceptance criteria. A backup reviewer must reproduce the conclusion from retained commands, fixtures, versions, and links.',
